(5899010, 859181, 70503, '<td valign="top">Was the intention to have only the white foot in focus? My eyes keep drawing to that location. I understand the concept of the image, I just wish it were a bit more in focus. Still a sound pic tho.</td>', 'Was the intention to have only the white foot in focus? My eyes keep drawing to that location. I understand the concept of the image, I just wish it were a bit more in focus. Still a sound pic tho.', '2010-03-10 18:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
