(5899017, 859612, 70503, '<td valign="top">The sun is a bit harsh on the faces. The older boy is squinting. I love the old car and the little one.</td>', 'The sun is a bit harsh on the faces. The older boy is squinting. I love the old car and the little one.', '2010-03-10 18:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
