(5899100, 859506, 15407, '<td valign="top">If only you could have captured more of his face... Oh yeah!!! I enjoy &amp; prefer doing Motorsport Photography. Damn if this sort of thing happens to often in that split second during pan!</td>', 'If only you could have captured more of his face... Oh yeah!!! I enjoy & prefer doing Motorsport Photography. Damn if this sort of thing happens to often in that split second during pan!', '2010-03-10 18:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
