(5899107, 859036, 15407, '<td valign="top">The blur on the boy actually works in this photo as the train is what he''s connected to during the action.</td>', 'The blur on the boy actually works in this photo as the train is what he''s connected to during the action.', '2010-03-10 18:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899109, 859725, 15407, '<td valign="top">Does it still work? Looks like the batterysmay have failed by the date on the packaging... Ha Ha !</td>', 'Does it still work? Looks like the batterysmay have failed by the date on the packaging... Ha Ha !', '2010-03-10 19:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899125, 859589, 15407, '<td valign="top">Colors are great. The dust on the surface under the car is distracting. The focus ~ shallow DOF isn''t. The crop on the right is distracting. I would be curious to see what settings you used.  I''ve expermeted with gettin back further from a subject matter such as this and still being able to get a DOF with all of the desireable subject matter included. By moving back as far as is possible with a Long lens and the smallest apature you can use to get the most focus using a long exposure.   I would love to have the real version of this Corvette as a ADULT Toy!</td>', 'Colors are great. The dust on the surface under the car is distracting. The focus ~ shallow DOF isn''t. The crop on the right is distracting. I would be curious to see what settings you used.  I''ve expermeted with gettin back further from a subject matter such as this and still being able to get a DOF with all of the desireable subject matter included. By moving back as far as is possible with a Long lens and the smallest apature you can use to get the most focus using a long exposure.   I would love to have the real version of this Corvette as a ADULT Toy!', '2010-03-10 19:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
