(5899424, 858770, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely expression, good back-lighting and shadows, crinkly bed sheet/curtain annoying and child''s hair could have been brushed a bit better. Hair on bear''s back could have been removed before shooting. Attention to detail is poor.</td>', 'Lovely expression, good back-lighting and shadows, crinkly bed sheet/curtain annoying and child''s hair could have been brushed a bit better. Hair on bear''s back could have been removed before shooting. Attention to detail is poor.', '2010-03-10 23:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899425, 859731, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, pity it''s washed out.</td>', 'Nice perspective, pity it''s washed out.', '2010-03-10 23:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899519, 859528, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great image, when you''ve lived it, as I have. Doubt if the homogenised western DPC voter will get it/enjoy it. Even though they are as poor as dirt, kids will still find something to entertain themselves with. Image is clean and colours accurate, kids expression is good. I would like to see a shot of one of the kids running down the street next to the tyre, using a stick to keep it spinning and on course. (Scooter?)</td>', 'Great image, when you''ve lived it, as I have. Doubt if the homogenised western DPC voter will get it/enjoy it. Even though they are as poor as dirt, kids will still find something to entertain themselves with. Image is clean and colours accurate, kids expression is good. I would like to see a shot of one of the kids running down the street next to the tyre, using a stick to keep it spinning and on course. (Scooter?)', '2010-03-11 01:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899521, 859698, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice comp but OOF</td>', 'Nice comp but OOF', '2010-03-11 01:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899522, 859612, 108580, '<td valign="top">Cute story. I''d like to have gotten Jr in the Jeep and the others looking at the camera for more impact.</td>', 'Cute story. I''d like to have gotten Jr in the Jeep and the others looking at the camera for more impact.', '2010-03-11 01:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899526, 859485, 108580, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, nice kiddies storybook image.</td>', 'Good lighting, nice kiddies storybook image.', '2010-03-11 01:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899529, 859708, 108580, '<td valign="top">I know this is getting hammered...because few of us really look.<br/>What is the definition of a "toy". A Chinese plastic lead based paint piece of junk, or what''s inside the child''s mind?<br/>Kids feet in the snow, and that''s enough of a playground/toy (snowball fight anyone?) for some :)<br/>DMC (Does Meet Challenge) although I will be in the minority I''m sure.<br/>Crisp clean image, leading lines add mystery to whom had just been there before me. And either a ski track or bicycle track indicating a 2nd person.<br/> <br/>I trust you read the challenge description and I haven''t made a total fool of myself hehe.</td>', 'I know this is getting hammered...because few of us really look.What is the definition of a "toy". A Chinese plastic lead based paint piece of junk, or what''s inside the child''s mind?Kids feet in the snow, and that''s enough of a playground/toy (snowball fight anyone?) for some :)DMC (Does Meet Challenge) although I will be in the minority I''m sure.Crisp clean image, leading lines add mystery to whom had just been there before me. And either a ski track or bicycle track indicating a 2nd person. I trust you read the challenge description and I haven''t made a total fool of myself hehe.', '2010-03-11 01:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899532, 858569, 108580, '<td valign="top">I love model trains but the exp is really off, sorry!</td>', 'I love model trains but the exp is really off, sorry!', '2010-03-11 01:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899533, 858497, 108580, '<td valign="top">Focus is really off sorry. Detail is destroyed because of it.</td>', 'Focus is really off sorry. Detail is destroyed because of it.', '2010-03-11 01:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899536, 859069, 108580, '<td valign="top">Moody and dark, almost Stephen King''ish. Wierd but apt in a few quarters.</td>', 'Moody and dark, almost Stephen King''ish. Wierd but apt in a few quarters.', '2010-03-11 01:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899537, 859080, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. DOF control good too. Where''s Darth Vader?</td>', 'Nicely composed. DOF control good too. Where''s Darth Vader?', '2010-03-11 01:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899635, 859474, 86218, '<td valign="top">LOL. I wouldnt mind a toy like this one. Bet it beats any feul consumption figures... I can hear the conversation. "How many miles do you get to a wind?"</td>', 'LOL. I wouldnt mind a toy like this one. Bet it beats any feul consumption figures... I can hear the conversation. "How many miles do you get to a wind?"', '2010-03-11 04:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
