(5913467, 858929, 108580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Magnum_za:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh man really nice composition, pity about the bloke bending over in the BG, still an 8 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ooops! I seldom read the title and prefer to appreciate the craftsmanship of the image without being biased by a title. Apologies to "Mum"!</td>', 'Originally posted by Magnum_za: Oh man really nice composition, pity about the bloke bending over in the BG, still an 8   Ooops! I seldom read the title and prefer to appreciate the craftsmanship of the image without being biased by a title. Apologies to "Mum"!', '2010-03-22 15:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
