(5916795, 859505, 46918, '<td valign="top">Thank you for this picture!!!! I read the articles about CW2 Defrenn that you had on your comments on this photo. I have personally served 2 tours in Iraq and have had several friends die in the line of duty. I hate that he had to leave a wife and new born baby that will never know him. He is in a better place now and I am sure that he is looking down on his family with many smiles.</td>', 'Thank you for this picture!!!! I read the articles about CW2 Defrenn that you had on your comments on this photo. I have personally served 2 tours in Iraq and have had several friends die in the line of duty. I hate that he had to leave a wife and new born baby that will never know him. He is in a better place now and I am sure that he is looking down on his family with many smiles.', '2010-03-24 22:34:45.000000', NULL, 0),
